1. FREE TIER
   Modules `atheros_kit.guard` and `atheros_kit.euact.classify`, together with
   `atheros_kit.core`, may be used without charge and without activation, for any
   purpose including commercial use, by any number of users, indefinitely.
   No telemetry is collected and no network call is made.

2. PAID TIERS
   Use of `atheros_kit.rag`, `atheros_kit.vendor`, `atheros_kit.cicd`, and
   dossier export requires a current Team or Enterprise licence.

3. WHAT THIS SOFTWARE IS
   The Software produces automated ASSESSMENTS and EVIDENCE. It does not
   certify, does not perform a conformity assessment within the meaning of
   Regulation (EU) 2024/1689, and does not constitute legal advice. Every report
   states the limits of what it measured, and those statements are part of the
   output, not a disclaimer appended to it.

4. NO WARRANTY AS TO COMPLIANCE OUTCOMES
   THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR
   IMPLIED. AtherosAI B.V. does not warrant that use of the Software will result
   in compliance with any law, regulation, or standard. Regulatory obligations
   rest with the customer, and no output of this Software transfers them.

5. REGULATION CONTENT
   Legal vocabulary ships as versioned data and every assessment records the
   version it was produced under. Content is maintained on a best-effort basis
   for the Free and Team tiers, and to the service level stated in the agreement
   for Enterprise. It may lag changes in the underlying law.

6. REDISTRIBUTION
   The Software may not be redistributed, sublicensed, or offered as a hosted
